{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"torch_post","model_identifier":"torch_post","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# torch_post\n\nTorch post: a wooden post about 1.8 m (64 u) tall with an iron cup at the top.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -4..4, y 0..75, z -4..4 units (0.25 x 2.11 x 0.25 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 16 x 128, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 11.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 8 x 64 x 8 post\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `lit` (visible by default): burning (glow_flame cubes in the child group `flame`)\n- `unlit`: cold cup of charred pitch\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `flicker` | 0.8 | loop | the flame group `flame` jitters (the light flicker itself is the game's) |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_flame` at (0, 68, 0)\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_flame, glow_flame_1, glow_flame_2, glow_flame_tongue\n"},"resolution":{"width":16,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"post","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.0,0.0,-2.0],"to":[2.0,58.0,2.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,4.0,58.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,4.0,58.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,4.0,58.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,4.0,58.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[10.0,88.0,14.0,92.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[10.0,88.0,14.0,92.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"22bc52ed-f7cb-5fe6-b922-abd43054eba8"},{"name":"foot","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission